{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VQHTrIcwWj1792682449.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣周四晚發生7級地震，當局啟動四級應急響應，暫時未有傷亡和損毀報告。</p><p></p><p>中國地震局測定事發在昨晚10時33分，震源深度10公里，巴青縣縣城有居民疏散到戶外暫避，距離巴青縣30公里的索縣有明顯震感，消防部門正趕去災區。</p><p></p><p>新華社指震央附近屬高原，平均海拔約4,800米，周邊人口稀少，國務院抗震救災指揮部啟動四級應急響應，指示相關部門全力做好搶險救援等工作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.750260+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:44.280477+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:56.112477+00:00","content_hash":"cf1f2955384911722aefdcd2f9a2d2aecc368955f07b39b91af70edbeb54b698","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.750260+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}